    {
      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nWhat is the total number of boxes Sunny sold over the weekend? On Saturday, Sunny sold 12 boxes of gingerbread.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat is the total number of boxes Sunny sold over the weekend? On Saturday, Sunny sold 12 boxes of gingerbread.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. On Saturday, Sunny sold 10 boxes of gingerbread.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. How many boxes did Sunny sell on Saturday if each customer bought two boxes? Additionally, each customer bought 2 boxes of gingerbread from Sunny on Saturday.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: On Sunday, Sunny sold 16 boxes of apple pie.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. On Sunday, Sunny sold 15 boxes of apple pie.\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"Here's another detail: Sunny sold the gingerbread and apple pie boxes during the same weekend.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Hmm, let me approach this from another angle. How much money did Sunny earn from selling gingerbread and apple pie over two days? By the way, here are some relevant details: On Saturday, Sunny sold 4 fewer boxes of apple pie than on Sunday. On Sunday, Sunny sold 5 more boxes of gingerbread than on Saturday. Each box of gingerbread cost $6, and each box of apple pie cost $15.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Saturday:\n- Gingerbread: \\(10\\) boxes\n- Apple pie: \\(15-4=11\\) boxes\n\nSunday:\n- Gingerbread: \\(10+5=15\\) boxes\n- Apple pie: \\(15\\) boxes\n\nTotal earnings from gingerbread:\n\\[\n(10+15)\\times \\$6=25\\times \\$6=\\$150\n\\]\n\nTotal earnings from apple pie:\n\\[\n(11+15)\\times \\$15=26\\times \\$15=\\$390\n\\]\n\nTherefore, Sunny earned:\n\\[\n\\$150+\\$390=\\boxed{\\$540}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    }
  ],
