  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Step 1: Sunny sold **12 boxes** on Saturday.  \nStep 2: The number of boxes sold on Sunday is not provided.  \nStep 3: Therefore, the total sold over the weekend cannot be determined from the given information.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Sunny sold **10 boxes on Saturday**, but the number sold on Sunday is not given. Therefore, the weekend total cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Sunny sold **10 boxes** on Saturday. Since each customer bought **2 boxes**, that means:\n\n\\[\n10 \\div 2 = 5 \\text{ customers}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{10\\text{ boxes}}\n\\]",
